      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "hell, let people put lil tags below their name, similar to the quest badge (or even put status on a badge). A few of my trans friends put their pronouns in their status, but ppl misgender them bc not many people check people's status before talking to/about them.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
