  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-04-01T01:04:38.961Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I know so many trans people who would love VRChat, but are afraid of constantly getting misgendered by strangers. I used to put my pronouns in my Steam name so they would show in-game, but those who use VRChat accounts can't do that (instead having to have unique one-per-player usernames that can only change once every three months)\nPlenty of trans people already talk about transphobic the VRChat community can be, so I feel like adding this as an option (nobody should be forced to display their pronouns) would go a long way to help trans people feel safer and more respected in a game that should be as fun for us as it is everybody else.",
